## Why This Is Asked

To assess practical integration of KMS-based encryption, tenant isolation, and auditability in KCNA at scale, including key rotation, revocation, and observability under load.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant KEK
- Envelope encryption
- Zero-downtime key rotation
